  "answer": "memo: Final Guide to Paying PNW Parking Citations\n\n**Official Payment Portal**: https://secure.touchnet.com/C21261_tsa/web/login.jsp [S8]\n\n**Payment Options**:\n- **Online**: Credit/Debit Cards (Visa, MasterCard, American Express, Discover) [S6] or Electronic Checking [S6] via TouchNet PayPath.\n- **In-Person**: Cash, personal check, cashier’s check, or money order [S6].\n- **By Mail**: Personal check, cashier’s check, or money order [S6].\n\n**What You Will Need**:\n- **For Online Payment**: \n    - Access to the TouchNet PayPath portal [S8].\n    - Payment details (Credit/Debit card info or Electronic Checking account details) [S6].\n- **For In-Person Payment**:\n    - Cash, check, or money order [S6].\n- **For Mail-in Payment**:\n    - Check or money order made payable to \"Purdue University Northwest\" [S6].\n    - Student's PUID number [S6].\n    - Student's name [S6].\n\n**Step-by-Step Instructions**:\n\n**Option 1: Online Payment**\n1. [unverified] Navigate to the official PNW TouchNet PayPath portal: https://secure.touchnet.com/C21261_tsa/web/login.jsp [S8].\n2. [unverified] Enter the required identification credentials (typically PUID or Citation Number) to access the specific citation charge.\n3. [unverified] Select the payment method:\n    - **Credit/Debit Card**: Enter card details. Note that a convenience fee applies (3.00% [S6] domestic / 4.25% [S6] international) [S6].\n    - **Electronic Checking**: Enter routing and account numbers to avoid convenience fees [S6].\n4. [unverified] Review the payment amount and submit.\n5. [unverified] Save or print the confirmation page for your records.\n\n**Option 2: In-Person Payment**\n1. [unverified] Prepare payment via cash, personal check, cashier’s check, or money order (Credit cards are NOT accepted in-office) [S6].\n2. [unverified] Visit the appropriate campus office:\n    - **Hammond Campus**: Lawshe Hall, Room 130 [S6].\n    - **Westville Campus**: Schwarz Hall, Room 158 [S6].\n3. [unverified] Alternatively, use the designated drop boxes available at either the Hammond or Westville campuses [S6].\n\n**Option 3: Payment by Mail**\n1. [unverified] Prepare a personal check, cashier’s check, or money order made payable to \"Purdue University Northwest\" [S6].\n2. [unverified] Clearly write the student's **PUID number** [S6] and **full name** [S6] on the check [S6].\n3. [unverified] Mail the payment to the Bursar’s Office at the relevant campus:\n    - **Hammond Campus**: 2200 [S6] 169th [S6] Street, Hammond, IN 46323 [S6].\n    - **Westville Campus**: 1401 [S6] South US Highway 421 [S6], Westville, IN 46391 [S6].\n\n## Limitations\nStep 3 (QA Specialist) was blocked from performing live site verification because `fetch_url` failed for the TouchNet portal and the payment PDF. Consequently, the specific form fields and the live navigation flow of the online portal were not manually traced, leaving the step-by-step instructions tagged as [unverified].",
